1
00:00:00,622 --> 00:00:02,152
(Howard(on phone):)Okay.

2
00:00:02,157 --> 00:00:04,787
(Penny:)Now imagine
you're holding that pen.

3
00:00:09,364 --> 00:00:11,364
(Howard(on phone):)Okay.

4
00:00:11,366 --> 00:00:14,606
(Penny:)Now open your hand
and let it go.

5
00:00:14,603 --> 00:00:16,733
(Sheldon:)But I just got this pen.

6
00:00:18,040 --> 00:00:20,710
(Sheldon:)It's got my initials on it
and everything.

7
00:00:20,709 --> 00:00:22,439
(Leonard:)Look.

8
00:00:24,179 --> 00:00:26,979
(Penny:)Sheldon, this isn't
that hard.

9
00:00:29,284 --> 00:00:31,754
(Sheldon:)I may have a better way
that you can teach me.

10
00:00:31,753 --> 00:00:33,183
(Penny:)How?

11
00:00:33,188 --> 00:00:36,858
(Sheldon:)What if I told you
that over the past few months

12
00:00:36,859 --> 00:00:39,859
(Sheldon:)Amy has secretly been giving you
little puzzles

13
00:00:39,862 --> 00:00:42,932
(Sheldon:)to test your intelligence
against chimpanzees in her lab?

14
00:00:45,067 --> 00:00:46,567
(Penny:)What? She didn't
give me any puzzles.

15
00:00:46,568 --> 00:00:48,768
(Sheldon:)Are you sure?

16
00:00:51,607 --> 00:00:55,037
(Amy(in flashback):)Boy, I just can't seem to get
these scissors back together.

17
00:00:55,043 --> 00:00:58,023
(Amy(in flashback):)Can you do it?

